WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.520
Freedom.

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:10.080
One nation in all human history was built on that bedrock-

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.540
ours.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.920
A republic of the people, by the people, and
for the people

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:26.179
Self-government requires freedom
Just as freedom requires an individual willingness

00:00:26.179 --> 00:00:32.210
to self-govern.
Freedom has made America exceptional… but

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:38.150
it can only last as long as you and I seek
the Good, as expressed by the laws of nature

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:43.370
and nature’s God.
It can only last if you and I choose to act

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
as people of character.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:52.160
Forging character has been the pursuit of

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:56.250
Hillsdale College since 1844

